  "description": "Author and maintain Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) for Salesforce implementations: capture chosen approach, rejected alternatives, constraints, and consequences. Trigger keywords: adr, architecture decision record, design decision log, technical decision. NOT for making the design decision itself, e.g. Flow vs Apex \u2014 use architect/solution-design-patterns. NOT for a formal architecture review that produces findings \u2014 use architect/well-architected-review.",
  "file_location": "skills/architect/architecture-decision-records",
